config VSENSE_PERIOD_MS
	int "Battery reading period (ms)"
	default 1000
	help
	  The one switch between vsense.elf (1000 ms: firmware.md section 2.2's
	  power_thread tick, "sample at most about 1 Hz" of section 12.4) and
	  vsense_50ms.elf (50 ms: the shortest burst interval of the
	  dial-me-spinner suite's test_sample_interval), the two sample rates of
	  the Phase 1 plan's E2 sample-rate check.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
